  "__belowAa": "Panel/text pairs that are under 4.5:1 today, pinned at the ratio they measure. Every one is text-ink-3 — the meta tier is derived to land exactly on 4.5:1 on paper, so any tint over that paper puts it under. Recorded rather than waived: the set has to match what the audit finds and each ratio has to match to 2dp, so a new failure, a worse one, or a fixed one still listed all go red.",
